      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5f2dea8d22470972dc58e995|full_name}: Even worse, it finds it as part of words... E.g. say someones name is Nishitsuru the filter will find \"shit\" in there and their name is now Nipooptsuru  \nI ran in to this problem uploading one of my avatars as well. The base is known as シトナ so I put it romanized as, \"Shitona\" oops... I can say I romanized it as \"Sitona\" in the next upload... (guess I could've just put it in kana...)\nIn a way this makes me feel this word filter is very anglocentric in something enjoyed by people all over the world...",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
